          asm-9.11.1.jar.sha1)
SHA-256:  ae4e6e10d59d0a1500317764b21881ad883f8550e33c66e6142f7032c6fb566c
License:  BSD-3-Clause (LICENSE.txt, from the ASM_9_11_1 tag of
